> Generated with the AI Coding Tool Validation Kit {{kit_version}}. Complete every `[fill in]` before review. Approval is given by the approver personally in the eQMS.

## 1. Purpose and scope

This work instruction tells everyone at {{org_name}} who uses an AI coding tool, or reviews work produced with one, how to do it safely and in line with the QMS. It applies to all tools in section 4, on every surface (IDE, CLI, cloud agent, PR review bot, CI), for every context of use in section 5, and to every team, including teams outside engineering that draft documents with these tools.

Using AI coding tools is encouraged. The rules below exist so that every change still reaches the product and the QMS only through qualified human control.

